    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an experienced SEO blog writer. Write a complete blog post about this topic.\n\nTOPIC: {{ $json.Topic }}\n\nRULES\n- Length: about 1,500 words in the article body (minimum 1,400, maximum 1,700). Do not stop short.\n- CURIOSITY: the title must spark curiosity and include the primary keyword, without false clickbait. Open with a hook (surprising question, bold contrast or real reader dilemma) before the answer. Write benefit-led H2 headings, and end sections with a line that pulls the reader to the next one. Frame why the topic is trending now and what readers often get wrong.\n- Write from well-established information only. Never invent quotes, statistics, scores, prices, dates, or names. If you are not sure about a recent detail, describe it in general terms or say it is unconfirmed.\n- Primary keyword = the topic. Work in 6 to 8 related long-tail keywords naturally. Use the primary keyword in the title, in the first 100 words, in one H2, and in the conclusion. No keyword stuffing.\n- Structure: a gripping short intro (2-3 sentences that hook the reader and promise what they will learn), then 5 to 7 H2 sections with H3s where useful, one bulleted list, one small \"key facts\" table, an H2 \"Frequently Asked Questions\" with 4 questions, and a conclusion.\n- Short paragraphs (max 3 sentences), simple English, active voice, friendly but credible.\n- Put the exact text [IMAGE_1] on its own line right after the intro, and [IMAGE_2] on its own line at the middle of the article.\n- Article = HTML only (h2, h3, p, ul, li, table, tr, th, td, strong). No h1, no html or body tags, no markdown, no CSS.\n- image_prompt: a clean editorial illustration or photo-style scene that fits the topic. No text, no logos, no real people's faces.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (exactly this, nothing before or after):\n===META===\n{\"title\":\"max 60 characters, includes the primary keyword\",\"description\":\"140 to 155 characters\",\"labels\":[\"3 to 5 short labels\"],\"keywords\":[\"...\"],\"image_prompt\":\"...\",\"image_alt\":\"...\"}\n===ARTICLE===\n<p>...</p>",
        "batching": {}
      },
